<title>SPAIN: Pryca 9-mo attributable up 14 pct.</title>
<headline>Pryca 9-mo attributable up 14 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for Spanish hypermarket Pryca in billions of pesetas, unless stated:</p>
